Not quite — Northline is purpose-built for request/ticket workflows, not general project management.

- **Scope** — explicitly not a general-purpose project management tool; it's scoped to request/ticket-style operational work like IT requests, facilities, and HR case management [1].
- **Core design** — built around a unified queue, adaptive automation, and shared status visibility rather than project/task planning features [1].

If you need broad project management alongside ticketing, it's worth checking [Pricing plans](https://northline.com/pricing) or talking to sales to confirm fit — see also https://northline.com/integrations for what connects in.